:after:shadow-focus stacks:after:transform-none! stacks:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill]:transform-none! stacks:[--cds-card-press-d:0px] stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:active]:after:bg-neutral-hover stacks:not-contrast-more:after:shadow-none stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:after:shadow-none stacks:not-contrast-more:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill]:bg-fill-card stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:after:bg-fill-card stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:not-has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:active]:hover:after:bg-neutral stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill]:bg-transparent stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:not-has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:active]:hover:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill:not(.bg-surface-2)]:[--cds-surface-2:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-card-hover)] gap-md"><span aria-hidden="true" class="cds-card-fill pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-[1] m-0 rounded-[inherit]"></span><div data-cds-card-body="" class="cds-card-body flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col self-stretch [gap:inherit] [align-items:inherit] [justify-content:inherit] rounded-[inherit] p-lg"><div data-cds="CardMedia" class="self-stretch -mx-pad-lg overflow-hidden first:-mt-pad-lg first:rounded-t-card first:not-only:border-b last:-mb-pad-lg last:rounded-b-card last:not-first:border-t"><div class="flex flex-col gap-xs bg-alpha-1 px-lg py-sm"><p class="flex items-center gap-xs text-footnote font-medium text-secondary"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(0.75rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:577.8" class="shrink-0 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></span>Web search tool</p></div></div><dl class="grid gap-x-lg gap-y-md grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-xs"><dt class="text-caption text-muted"><a href="#feature-availability" class="cds-reset cds-text-link cds-text-link-underline inline text-inherit [transition-property:text-decoration-color,box-shadow] [&amp;:not(:hover,:focus-visible)]:[--_text-link-line:color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor,transparent_35%)] cursor-pointer" data-inherit-color="" data-cds="TextLink">APIs</a></dt><dd class="flex flex-col items-start gap-xs text-footnote text-primary wrap-anywhere"><span class="flex flex-col gap-xs"><span class="grid items-center gap-x-xs grid-cols-[auto_1fr]"><span class="inline-flex" title="Available"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" class="shrink-0 text-success" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>Messages API<span class="sr-only">Available</span></span></span><span class="flex flex-col gap-xs"><span class="grid items-center gap-x-xs grid-cols-[auto_1fr]"><span class="inline-flex" title="Available"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" class="shrink-0 text-success" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>Managed Agents<span class="sr-only">Available</span></span></span></dd></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-xs"><dt class="text-caption text-muted"><a href="#availability-feature-support" class="cds-reset cds-text-link cds-text-link-underline inline text-inherit [transition-property:text-decoration-color,box-shadow] [&amp;:not(:hover,:focus-visible)]:[--_text-link-line:color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor,transparent_35%)] cursor-pointer" data-inherit-color="" data-cds="TextLink">Cloud platforms</a></dt><dd class="flex flex-col items-start gap-xs text-footnote text-primary wrap-anywhere"><span class="flex flex-col gap-xs"><span class="grid items-center gap-x-xs grid-cols-[auto_1fr]"><span class="inline-flex" title="Available"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" class="shrink-0 text-success" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>Claude API<span class="sr-only">Available</span></span></span><span class="flex flex-col gap-xs"><span class="grid items-center gap-x-xs grid-cols-[auto_1fr]"><span class="inline-flex" title="Available"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" class="shrink-0 text-success" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>Claude Platform on AWS<span class="sr-only">Available</span></span></span><span class="flex flex-col gap-xs"><span class="grid items-center gap-x-xs grid-cols-[auto_1fr]"><span class="inline-flex" title="Available"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" class="shrink-0 text-success" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>Claude Models on Google Cloud<span class="text-caption text-secondary col-start-2">Anthropic managed</span><span class="sr-only">Available</span></span></span><span class="flex flex-col gap-xs"><span class="grid items-center gap-x-xs grid-cols-[auto_1fr]"><span class="inline-flex" title="Available"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" class="shrink-0 text-success" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>Claude Models on Google Cloud<span class="text-caption text-secondary col-start-2">Google managed</span><span class="sr-only">Available</span></span></span><span class="flex flex-col gap-xs"><span class="grid items-center gap-x-xs grid-cols-[auto_1fr]"><span class="inline-flex" title="Available"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" class="shrink-0 text-success" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>Microsoft Foundry<span class="sr-only">Available</span></span></span></dd></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-xs"><dt class="text-caption text-muted"><a href="#feature-data-handling" class="cds-reset cds-text-link cds-text-link-underline inline text-inherit [transition-property:text-decoration-color,box-shadow] [&amp;:not(:hover,:focus-visible)]:[--_text-link-line:color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor,transparent_35%)] cursor-pointer" data-inherit-color="" data-cds="TextLink">Data handling</a></dt><dd class="flex flex-col items-start gap-xs text-footnote text-primary wrap-anywhere"><span class="flex flex-col gap-xs"><span class="grid items-center gap-x-xs grid-cols-[auto_1fr]"><span class="inline-flex"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" class="shrink-0 text-success" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>ZDR eligible</span></span><span class="flex flex-col gap-xs"><span class="grid items-center gap-x-xs grid-cols-[auto_1fr]"><span class="inline-flex"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" class="shrink-0 text-success" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>HIPAA eligible</span></span></dd></div></dl></div></div></aside></div><div id="feature-api-support" data-not-prose="true" class="prose-block scroll-mt-24"><div data-cds="Card" class="group/card relative isolate flex flex-col rounded-card after:pointer-events-none after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-[inherit] after:shadow-card-ring after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:focus-visible]:after:shadow-focus stacks:after:transform-none! stacks:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill]:transform-none! stacks:[--cds-card-press-d:0px] stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:active]:after:bg-neutral-hover stacks:not-contrast-more:after:shadow-none stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:after:shadow-none stacks:not-contrast-more:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill]:bg-fill-card stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:after:bg-fill-card stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:not-has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:active]:hover:after:bg-neutral stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill]:bg-transparent stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:not-has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:active]:hover:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill:not(.bg-surface-2)]:[--cds-surface-2:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-card-hover)]"><span aria-hidden="true" class="cds-card-fill pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-[1] m-0 rounded-[inherit]"></span><div data-cds-card-body="" class="cds-card-body flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col self-stretch [gap:inherit] [align-items:inherit] [justify-content:inherit] rounded-[inherit] p-lg"><div data-cds="CardMedia" class="self-stretch -mx-pad-lg overflow-hidden first:-mt-pad-lg first:rounded-t-card first:not-only:border-b last:-mb-pad-lg last:rounded-b-card last:not-first:border-t"><p class="flex items-center gap-xs border-b bg-alpha-1 px-lg py-xs text-footnote text-primary"><span data-cds="Icon" data-cds-mirror="" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" class="shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></span>Usage differs by product</p><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col not-first:max-sm:border-t not-first:sm:border-s"><div class="flex flex-col gap-xs p-lg"><div class="flex items-center gap-xs text-body font-medium text-primary"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" class="shrink-0 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></span>Messages API</div><span class="text-footnote text-secondary">Add a <code class="text-code wrap-anywhere">web_search</code> tool to the request’s <code class="text-code wrap-anywhere">tools</code>. Settings such as <code class="text-code wrap-anywhere">max_uses</code>, domain lists and <code class="text-code wrap-anywhere">user_location</code> go on that tool.</span></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col not-first:max-sm:border-t not-first:sm:border-s"><div class="flex flex-col gap-xs p-lg"><div class="flex items-center gap-xs text-body font-medium text-primary"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" class="shrink-0 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></span>Managed Agents</div><span class="text-footnote text-secondary">On by default in the agent toolset, without <code class="text-code wrap-anywhere">max_uses</code>, <code class="text-code wrap-anywhere">citations</code> or <code class="text-code wrap-anywhere">cache_control</code>.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><p>The web search tool gives Claude direct access to real-time web content, allowing it to answer questions with up-to-date information beyond its knowledge cutoff. The response includes citations for sources drawn from search results.</p>
<p>With <code>web_search_20260209</code> and later versions, Claude can write and run code that filters the search results before they reach the context window (<strong>dynamic filtering</strong>), keeping only relevant information. Dynamic filtering is available with Claude 4.6 and later models and <a href="https://anthropic.com/glasswing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Claude Mythos Preview</a>.</p>
<p>Three versions of the web search tool are available:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>web_search_20250305</code>: basic web search</li>
<li><code>web_search_20260209</code>: adds <a href="#dynamic-filtering">dynamic filtering</a></li>
<li><code>web_search_20260318</code>: adds <a href="#response-inclusion">response inclusion</a> control for agentic workflows</li>
</ul>
<p>The examples on this page use <code>web_search_20250305</code> for basic search and <code>web_search_20260318</code> for dynamic filtering.</p>
<aside data-cds="Aside" data-prose-box="" data-icon-layout="first-line" role="note" class="flex items-start gap-xs rounded-card px-lg py-md font-sans text-body font-normal break-words bg-surface-1 layers-1-[color:var(--cds-banner-neutral-tint)] text-primary shadow-[inset_0_0_0_var(--cds-ring-inner)_var(--cds-banner-neutral-ring,var(--cds-ring-color)),0_0_0_var(--cds-ring-outer)_var(--cds-banner-neutral-ring,var(--cds-ring-color))] [--cds-prose-code-color:initial] [--cds-prose-marker-color:var(--cds-text-secondary)] [--cds-text-link-color:initial] prose-block print:break-inside-avoid print:[:is(h2,h3,h4)+&amp;]:break-after-avoid"><span class="flex min-h-[1lh] shrink-0 items-center"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:433.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p>For <a href="https://anthropic.com/glasswing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Claude Mythos Preview</a>, web search is supported on the Claude API, Claude Models on Google Cloud (Google managed), and Microsoft Foundry.</p></div></aside>
<p>For web search’s Zero Data Retention eligibility and the related <code>allowed_callers</code> configuration, see <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/server-tools#zdr-and-allowed-callers">Server tools</a>.</p>
<p>For model support, see the <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/tool-reference">Tool reference</a>.</p>
<p>To check whether a model accepts web search before you send a request, read its <code>capabilities.server_tools.web_search.supported</code> value from the Models API. <a href="/docs/en/models/overview#using-the-models-api">Using the Models API</a> describes the field.</p>
<h2 id="how-web-search-works" class="group">How web search works<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to How web search works" id="_R_k4vcqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h2>
<p>When you add the web search tool to your API request:</p>
<ol>
<li>Claude determines when to search based on the prompt.</li>
<li>The API runs the searches and provides Claude with the results. This process can repeat multiple times throughout a single request.</li>
<li>At the end of its turn, Claude provides a final response with cited sources.</li>
</ol>
<h3 id="when-claude-searches" class="group">When Claude searches<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to When Claude searches" id="_R_k6fcqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h3>
<p>Claude searches when the request depends on information that is current, changing, or outside its training data:</p>
<ul>
<li>Recent events, news, or announcements</li>
<li>Current prices, rates, scores, or statistics</li>
<li>Information about specific organizations, people, or products that might have changed</li>
<li>Explicit requests to search or look something up</li>
</ul>
<p>Claude answers directly without searching when the request draws on stable knowledge:</p>
<ul>
<li>Established facts, math, science fundamentals, or coding concepts</li>
<li>Creative writing or brainstorming</li>
<li>Analysis of content already provided in the conversation</li>
<li>Conversational turns and greetings</li>
</ul>
<p>Triggering is steerable through your system prompt: you can encourage Claude to search more readily or to prefer answering directly. To enforce a limit, use <a href="#max-uses"><code>max_uses</code></a> to cap the number of searches in a turn.</p>
<h3 id="dynamic-filtering" class="group">Dynamic filtering<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to Dynamic filtering" id="_R_k9fcqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h3>
<p>With basic web search, every search result is loaded into Claude’s context window, and much of that content can be irrelevant to the request. With <code>web_search_20260209</code> or later, Claude instead writes and runs code that filters the results first, so only relevant content reaches the context window. This reduces token use on search-heavy requests.</p>
<p>Dynamic filtering runs web search from inside <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/code-execution-tool">code execution</a>: on <code>web_search_20260209</code> and later, the tool’s <code>allowed_callers</code> field defaults to <code>[&quot;code_execution_20260120&quot;]</code>, and when dynamic filtering runs, the API provisions the code execution it needs for the request automatically. You don’t need to add the code execution tool to <code>tools</code> yourself. There are no additional charges for code execution calls made this way beyond the standard token costs.</p>
<p>To call web search directly, without dynamic filtering, set <code>allowed_callers: [&quot;direct&quot;]</code>. Models that don’t support programmatic tool calling require this setting. Without it, the API returns a 400 error that tells you to set it.</p>
<aside data-cds="Aside" data-prose-box="" data-icon-layout="first-line" role="note" class="flex items-start gap-xs rounded-card px-lg py-md font-sans text-body font-normal break-words bg-surface-1 layers-1-[color:var(--cds-banner-neutral-tint)] text-primary shadow-[inset_0_0_0_var(--cds-ring-inner)_var(--cds-banner-neutral-ring,var(--cds-ring-color)),0_0_0_var(--cds-ring-outer)_var(--cds-banner-neutral-ring,var(--cds-ring-color))] [--cds-prose-code-color:initial] [--cds-prose-marker-color:var(--cds-text-secondary)] [--cds-text-link-color:initial] prose-block print:break-inside-avoid print:[:is(h2,h3,h4)+&amp;]:break-after-avoid"><span class="flex min-h-[1lh] shrink-0 items-center"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:433.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p>The web search tool (with and without dynamic filtering) is available on the Claude API, <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/claude-platform-on-aws">Claude Platform on AWS</a>, <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/claude-models-on-google-cloud/anthropic-managed">Claude Models on Google Cloud (Anthropic managed)</a>, and <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/claude-in-microsoft-foundry">Microsoft Foundry</a>. On Microsoft Foundry, deployments <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/claude-in-microsoft-foundry#additional-features-not-supported-when-hosted-on-azure">hosted on Azure</a> support only the basic web search tool (<code>web_search_20250305</code>, without dynamic filtering). Deployments hosted on Anthropic support all versions. On Claude Models on Google Cloud (Google managed), only the basic web search tool (without dynamic filtering) is available.</p></div></aside>
<p>The following examples use <code>web_search_20260318</code>:</p>
