ate="no"><pre class="shiki"><code><span class="line">client <span class="lk">=</span> anthropic.Anthropic()</span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line">response <span class="lk">=</span> client.messages.create(</span>
<span class="line"><span class="lj dc">    model</span><span class="lk">=</span><span class="l3 dn">"claude-opus-5-5"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="lj dc">    max_tokens</span><span class="lk">=</span><span class="l1 di">4096</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="lj dc">    messages</span><span class="lk">=</span>[</span>
<span class="line">        {</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l3 dn">            "role"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"user"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l3 dn">            "content"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"Search for the current prices of AAPL and GOOGL, then calculate which has a better P/E ratio."</span>,</span>
<span class="line">        }</span>
<span class="line">    ],</span>
<span class="line"><span class="lj dc">    tools</span><span class="lk">=</span>[{<span class="l3 dn">"type"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"web_search_20260318"</span>, <span class="l3 dn">"name"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"web_search"</span>}],</span>
<span class="line">)</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l1 dt">print</span>(response)</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div>
<h2 id="how-to-use-web-search" class="group">How to use web search<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to How to use web search" id="_R_kcvcqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h2>
<aside data-cds="Aside" data-prose-box="" data-icon-layout="first-line" role="note" class="flex items-start gap-xs rounded-card px-lg py-md font-sans text-body font-normal break-words bg-surface-1 layers-1-[color:var(--cds-banner-neutral-tint)] text-primary shadow-[inset_0_0_0_var(--cds-ring-inner)_var(--cds-banner-neutral-ring,var(--cds-ring-color)),0_0_0_var(--cds-ring-outer)_var(--cds-banner-neutral-ring,var(--cds-ring-color))] [--cds-prose-code-color:initial] [--cds-prose-marker-color:var(--cds-text-secondary)] [--cds-text-link-color:initial] prose-block print:break-inside-avoid print:[:is(h2,h3,h4)+&amp;]:break-after-avoid"><span class="flex min-h-[1lh] shrink-0 items-center"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:433.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p>Web search is enabled for your organization unless an administrator has disabled it in the <a href="/settings/capabilities">Claude Console</a>, where they can also restrict which domains it searches. If it’s disabled, a Messages API request that includes the tool fails with a 400 <code>invalid_request_error</code> that says web search is not enabled, rather than an <a href="#errors">error code</a> inside a search result.</p></div></aside>
<p>For how your organization’s web search settings apply in Claude Managed Agents sessions, see <a href="/docs/en/managed-agents/tools-web-restrictions">Restrict web search and web fetch domains</a>.</p>
<p>Provide the web search tool in your API request:</p>
