<p>Here’s an example response structure:</p>
<div data-copy-scope="" class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border bg-surface-2 print:[p+&amp;]:break-before-avoid group relative prose-block [&amp;&gt;[data-not-prose]]:mt-0"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b px-4 py-1 print:break-after-avoid print:py-sm not-prose"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2 text-caption text-muted">Output</div><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 print:hidden"><span class="contents group-[:not(:has([data-code-source]))]/codegroup:hidden"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="sm" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] text-muted" aria-label="Copy code" id="_R_7iqfcqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:433.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span></span></div></div><div data-not-prose="true" tabindex="0" class="relative h-full py-4 pl-4 text-code overflow-x-auto focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 print:overflow-visible"><div class="inline-block min-w-full pr-4 print:block" data-code-source="" translate="no"><pre class="shiki"><code><span class="line">{</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">  "role"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"assistant"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">  "content"</span>: [</span>
<span class="line"><span class="lg d7">    // 1. Claude's decision to search</span></span>
<span class="line">    {</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">      "type"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"text"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">      "text"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"I'll search for when Claude Shannon was born."</span></span>
<span class="line">    },</span>
<span class="line"><span class="lg d7">    // 2. The search query used</span></span>
<span class="line">    {</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">      "type"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"server_tool_use"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">      "id"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"srvtoolu_01WYG3ziw53XMcoyKL4XcZmE"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">      "name"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"web_search"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">      "input"</span>: {</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">        "query"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"claude shannon birth date"</span></span>
<span class="line">      }</span>
<span class="line">    },</span>
<span class="line"><span class="lg d7">    // 3. Search results</span></span>
<span class="line">    {</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">      "type"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"web_search_tool_result"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">      "tool_use_id"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"srvtoolu_01WYG3ziw53XMcoyKL4XcZmE"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">      "content"</span>: [</span>
<span class="line">        {</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">          "type"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"web_search_result"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">          "url"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Claude_Shannon"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">          "title"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"Claude Shannon - Wikipedia"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">          "encrypted_content"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"EqgfCioIARgBIiQ3YTAwMjY1Mi1mZjM5LTQ1NGUtODgxNC1kNjNjNTk1ZWI3Y..."</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">          "page_age"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"April 30, 2025"</span></span>
<span class="line">        }</span>
<span class="line">      ]</span>
<span class="line">    },</span>
<span class="line">    {</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">      "text"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"Based on the search results, "</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">      "type"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"text"</span></span>
<span class="line">    },</span>
<span class="line"><span class="lg d7">    // 4. Claude's response with citations</span></span>
<span class="line">    {</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">      "text"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"Claude Shannon was born on April 30, 1916, in Petoskey, Michigan"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">      "type"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"text"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">      "citations"</span>: [</span>
<span class="line">        {</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">          "type"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"web_search_result_location"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">          "url"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Claude_Shannon"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">          "title"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"Claude Shannon - Wikipedia"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">          "encrypted_index"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"Eo8BCioIAhgBIiQyYjQ0OWJmZi1lNm.."</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">          "cited_text"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"Claude Elwood Shannon (April 30, 1916 – February 24, 2001) was an American mathematician, electrical engineer, computer scientist, cryptographer and i..."</span></span>
<span class="line">        }</span>
<span class="line">      ]</span>
<span class="line">    }</span>
<span class="line">  ],</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">  "id"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"msg_a930390d3a"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">  "usage"</span>: {</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">    "input_tokens"</span>: <span class="l1 di">6039</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">    "output_tokens"</span>: <span class="l1 di">931</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">    "server_tool_use"</span>: {</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">      "web_search_requests"</span>: <span class="l1 di">1</span></span>
<span class="line">    }</span>
<span class="line">  },</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">  "stop_reason"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"end_turn"</span></span>
<span class="line">}</span></code></pre></div></div></div>
<p>This example shows a direct search. When a search runs through <a href="#dynamic-filtering">dynamic filtering</a>, the response also contains the result blocks of the <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/code-execution-tool">code execution tool</a>, and each nested <code>server_tool_use</code> and <code>web_search_tool_result</code> pair carries a <code>caller</code> field identifying the code execution call that made it.</p>
<h3 id="search-results" class="group">Search results<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to Search results" id="_R_krfcqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h3>
<p>Search results include:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>url</code>: The URL of the source page</li>
<li><code>title</code>: The title of the source page</li>
<li><code>page_age</code>: When the site was last updated</li>
<li><code>encrypted_content</code>: Encrypted content that you must pass back in multi-turn conversations</li>
</ul>
<p>To continue a conversation that contains search results, send the assistant’s content blocks back exactly as you received them, including each result’s <code>encrypted_content</code>. The API decrypts that content in later requests to restore the search results in Claude’s context. If <code>encrypted_content</code> is missing or modified, the request fails with a 400 validation error.</p>
<h3 id="citations" class="group">Citations<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to Citations" id="_R_ktfcqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h3>
<p>Citations are always enabled for web search, and each <code>web_search_result_location</code> includes:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>url</code>: The URL of the cited source</li>
<li><code>title</code>: The title of the cited source</li>
<li><code>encrypted_index</code>: A reference that must be passed back for multi-turn conversations</li>
<li><code>cited_text</code>: Up to 150 characters of the cited content</li>
</ul>
<p>The web search citation fields <code>cited_text</code>, <code>title</code>, and <code>url</code> do not count toward input or output token usage.</p>
<aside data-cds="Aside" data-prose-box="" data-icon-layout="first-line" role="note" class="flex items-start gap-xs rounded-card px-lg py-md font-sans text-body font-normal break-words bg-surface-1 layers-1-[color:var(--cds-banner-neutral-tint)] text-primary shadow-[inset_0_0_0_var(--cds-ring-inner)_var(--cds-banner-neutral-ring,var(--cds-ring-color)),0_0_0_var(--cds-ring-outer)_var(--cds-banner-neutral-ring,var(--cds-ring-color))] [--cds-prose-code-color:initial] [--cds-prose-marker-color:var(--cds-text-secondary)] [--cds-text-link-color:initial] prose-block print:break-inside-avoid print:[:is(h2,h3,h4)+&amp;]:break-after-avoid"><span class="flex min-h-[1lh] shrink-0 items-center"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:433.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p>When displaying API outputs directly to end users, citations must be included to the original source. If you are making modifications to API outputs, including by reprocessing or combining them with your own material before displaying them to end users, display citations as appropriate based on consultation with your legal team.</p></div></aside>
<h3 id="errors" class="group">Errors<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to Errors" id="_R_kvvcqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h3>
<p>When the web search tool encounters an error (such as hitting rate limits), the Claude API still returns a 200 (success) response. The error is represented within the response body using the following structure:</p>
<div data-copy-scope="" class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border bg-surface-2 print:[p+&amp;]:break-before-avoid group relative prose-block [&amp;&gt;[data-not-prose]]:mt-0"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b px-4 py-1 print:break-after-avoid print:py-sm not-prose"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2 text-caption text-muted">Output</div><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 print:hidden"><span class="contents group-[:not(:has([data-code-source]))]/codegroup:hidden"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="sm" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] text-muted" aria-label="Copy code" id="_R_7j0vcqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:433.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span></span></div></div><div data-not-prose="true" tabindex="0" class="relative h-full py-4 pl-4 text-code overflow-x-auto focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 print:overflow-visible"><div class="inline-block min-w-full pr-4 print:block" data-code-source="" translate="no"><pre class="shiki"><code><span class="line">{</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">  "type"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"web_search_tool_result"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">  "tool_use_id"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"srvtoolu_a93jad"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">  "content"</span>: {</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">    "type"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"web_search_tool_result_error"</span>,</span>
<span class="line"><span class="l5 dc">    "error_code"</span>: <span class="l3 dn">"max_uses_exceeded"</span></span>
<span class="line">  }</span>
<span class="line">}</span></code></pre></div></div></div>
<p>On an error, <code>content</code> is a single error object rather than a list of result blocks. A search that succeeds but matches no results returns an empty <code>content</code> list, not an error.</p>
<p>These are the possible error codes:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>too_many_requests</code>: Rate limit exceeded</li>
<li><code>invalid_tool_input</code>: Invalid search query parameter</li>
<li><code>max_uses_exceeded</code>: Maximum web search tool uses exceeded</li>
<li><code>query_too_long</code>: Query exceeds maximum length</li>
<li><code>request_too_large</code>: The search request is too large, typically because of a long domain filter list</li>
<li><code>unavailable</code>: An internal error occurred</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="pause-turn-stop-reason" class="group"><code>pause_turn</code> stop reason<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to pause_turn stop reason" id="_R_l2vcqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h3>
<p>The API can pause a long-running search turn and return <code>stop_reason: &quot;pause_turn&quot;</code>. To continue, send the paused assistant message back unchanged in a new request.</p>
<p>If Claude calls web search and one of your client tools in the same group of parallel tool calls, the API returns <code>stop_reason: &quot;tool_use&quot;</code> instead and does not run the search yet. To continue, return the client tool results, and the API runs the search in the next request. See <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/server-tools#mixing-server-tools-and-client-tools-in-one-turn">Mixing server tools and client tools in one turn</a>.</p>
<p>For the server-side loop and <code>pause_turn</code> handling, see <a href="/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/server-tools#the-server-side-loop-and-pause-turn">The server-side loop and pause_turn</a> in the Server tools guide.</p>
