n font-medium font-badge leading-[round(1.25em,1px)] shrink-0 bg-tint-green text-tint-green stacks:rounded-[calc(var(--cds-h-control-nested)/2)] stacks:border stacks:border-solid stacks:border-transparent stacks:px-[calc(var(--cds-pad-sm)-1px)]"><span class="pb-[0.05em] stacks:pb-0">Available</span></span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-xs @md:col-span-2"><span class="text-footnote text-secondary">Cloud platforms</span><ul class="grid items-start gap-x-md gap-y-xs text-body text-primary @md:grid-cols-2"><li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] items-start gap-x-xs"><span class="flex min-h-lh items-center"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" class="shrink-0 text-success" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><span><a class="cds-reset cds-text-link cds-text-link-underline inline text-inherit [transition-property:text-decoration-color,box-shadow] [&amp;:not(:hover,:focus-visible)]:[--_text-link-line:color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor,transparent_35%)] cursor-pointer" data-inherit-color="" data-cds="TextLink" href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/claude-models-on-google-cloud/google-managed">Claude Models on Google Cloud</a></span><span class="col-start-2 text-footnote text-secondary">Google managed</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] items-start gap-x-xs"><span class="flex min-h-lh items-center"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" class="shrink-0 text-success" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><span><a class="cds-reset cds-text-link cds-text-link-underline inline text-inherit [transition-property:text-decoration-color,box-shadow] [&amp;:not(:hover,:focus-visible)]:[--_text-link-line:color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor,transparent_35%)] cursor-pointer" data-inherit-color="" data-cds="TextLink" href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/claude-in-microsoft-foundry">Microsoft Foundry</a></span><span class="col-start-2 text-footnote text-secondary">Hosted on Azure</span></li></ul></div><span class="text-footnote text-secondary @md:col-span-2 @md:col-start-2">Only the basic web search tool (<code class="text-code wrap-anywhere">web_search_20250305</code>), without dynamic filtering.</span></div></div></div></div><div data-cds="Card" class="group/card relative isolate flex flex-col rounded-card after:pointer-events-none after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-[inherit] after:shadow-card-ring after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:focus-visible]:after:shadow-focus stacks:after:transform-none! stacks:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill]:transform-none! stacks:[--cds-card-press-d:0px] stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:active]:after:bg-neutral-hover stacks:not-contrast-more:after:shadow-none stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:after:shadow-none stacks:not-contrast-more:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill]:bg-fill-card stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:after:bg-fill-card stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:not-has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:active]:hover:after:bg-neutral stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill]:bg-transparent stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:not-has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:active]:hover:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill:not(.bg-surface-2)]:[--cds-surface-2:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-card-hover)]"><span aria-hidden="true" class="cds-card-fill pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-[1] m-0 rounded-[inherit]"></span><div data-cds-card-body="" class="cds-card-body flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col self-stretch [gap:inherit] [align-items:inherit] [justify-content:inherit] rounded-[inherit] p-lg"><div data-cds="CardMedia" class="self-stretch -mx-pad-lg overflow-hidden first:-mt-pad-lg first:rounded-t-card first:not-only:border-b last:-mb-pad-lg last:rounded-b-card last:not-first:border-t"><div class="flex flex-col items-start border-b p-lg"><div class="text-body text-primary"><div class="flex items-center gap-xs text-body font-medium text-primary"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" class="shrink-0 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></span><a class="cds-reset cds-text-link cds-text-link-underline inline text-inherit [transition-property:text-decoration-color,box-shadow] [&amp;:not(:hover,:focus-visible)]:[--_text-link-line:color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor,transparent_35%)] cursor-pointer" data-inherit-color="" data-cds="TextLink" href="/docs/en/managed-agents/overview">Managed Agents</a></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-xs p-lg"><p class="text-body font-medium text-primary">Usage</p><p class="text-body text-secondary">Part of the agent toolset, and on by default once the toolset is added. Domain lists and <code class="text-code wrap-anywhere">user_location</code> go on the toolset’s <code class="text-code wrap-anywhere">web_search</code> entry; <code class="text-code wrap-anywhere">max_uses</code>, <code class="text-code wrap-anywhere">citations</code> and <code class="text-code wrap-anywhere">cache_control</code> are not available.</p></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="separator" aria-orientation="horizontal" data-cds="Separator" class="shrink-0 bg-border forced-colors:bg-[color:CanvasText] h-px w-stretch"></div><div class="grid gap-md p-lg @md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr_2fr]"><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-xs"><span class="text-footnote text-secondary">Status</span><span data-cds="Badge" data-size="sm" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 align-middle h-control-nested whitespace-nowrap rounded-chip px-sm font-sans text-caption font-medium font-badge leading-[round(1.25em,1px)] shrink-0 bg-tint-green text-tint-green stacks:rounded-[calc(var(--cds-h-control-nested)/2)] stacks:border stacks:border-solid stacks:border-transparent stacks:px-[calc(var(--cds-pad-sm)-1px)]"><span class="pb-[0.05em] stacks:pb-0">Available</span></span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-xs @md:col-span-2"><span class="text-footnote text-secondary">Cloud platforms</span><ul class="grid items-start gap-x-md gap-y-xs text-body text-primary @md:gri