"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h3><a class="cds-reset cds-text-link inline-flex items-baseline gap-[0.25em] [--cds-text-link-color:initial] cursor-pointer" data-cds="TextLink" href="/docs/en/manage-claude/api-and-data-retention#feature-eligibility"><span class="cds-text-link-underline">Data handling overview</span><span data-cds="Icon" data-cds-mirror="" style="font-size:1lh;font-weight:533.3" class="self-center" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div><div data-not-prose="true" class="prose-block"><div data-cds="Card" class="group/card relative isolate flex flex-col rounded-card after:pointer-events-none after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-[inherit] after:shadow-card-ring after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:focus-visible]:after:shadow-focus stacks:after:transform-none! stacks:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill]:transform-none! stacks:[--cds-card-press-d:0px] stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:active]:after:bg-neutral-hover stacks:not-contrast-more:after:shadow-none stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:after:shadow-none stacks:not-contrast-more:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill]:bg-fill-card stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:after:bg-fill-card stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:not-has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:active]:hover:after:bg-neutral stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill]:bg-transparent stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:not-has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:active]:hover:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill:not(.bg-surface-2)]:[--cds-surface-2:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-card-hover)]"><span aria-hidden="true" class="cds-card-fill pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-[1] m-0 rounded-[inherit]"></span><div data-cds-card-body="" class="cds-card-body flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col self-stretch [gap:inherit] [align-items:inherit] [justify-content:inherit] rounded-[inherit] p-lg"><div data-cds="CardMedia" class="self-stretch -mx-pad-lg overflow-hidden first:-mt-pad-lg first:rounded-t-card first:not-only:border-b last:-mb-pad-lg last:rounded-b-card last:not-first:border-t"><div class="flex flex-col gap-xs border-b p-lg"><p class="text-body font-medium text-primary">Applicable endpoints</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-xs text-body text-primary"><li><code class="text-code wrap-anywhere">/v1/messages</code> with <code class="text-code wrap-anywhere">web_search</code> tool</li></ul></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="flex flex-col gap-md p-lg"><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-xs"><span class="text-footnote text-secondary">Zero data retention</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-xs text-body text-primary"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" class="shrink-0 text-success" aria-hidden="true"></span>Eligible</span></div><p class="text-body text-secondary">Excludes <a class="cds-reset cds-text-link cds-text-link-underline inline text-inherit [transition-property:text-decoration-color,box-shadow] [&amp;:not(:hover,:focus-visible)]:[--_text-link-line:color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor,transparent_35%)] cursor-pointer" data-inherit-color="" data-cds="TextLink" href="/docs/en/manage-claude/api-and-data-retention#model-specific-data-retention-requirements">Covered Models</a></p><p class="text-body text-secondary">Real-time web search results returned in the API response. Dynamic filtering for web search is not eligible for ZDR or HIPAA.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col border-t sm:border-t-0 sm:border-s"><div class="flex flex-col gap-md p-lg"><div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-xs"><span class="text-footnote text-secondary">HIPAA</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-xs text-body text-primary"><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" class="shrink-0 text-success" aria-hidden="true"></span>Eligible</span></div><p class="text-body text-secondary">Dynamic filtering for web search is not eligible for ZDR or HIPAA.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-sm border-t pt-6 print:hidden"><p class="text-secondary text-body font-medium">Was this page helpful?</p><div class="flex items-center gap-xs"><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" class="cds-reset group/btn relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)]" aria-label="Thumbs up" id="_R_mkqalubtabsknr5td9leailb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn