",\"$41\",\"$42\",\"$43\",\"$44\",\"$45\",\"$46\",\"$47\",\"$48\",\"$49\",\"$4a\",\"$4b\",\"$4c\",\"$4d\",\"$4e\",\"$4f\",\"$50\",\"$51\",\"$52\",\"$53\",\"$54\",\"$6b\",\"$6c\",\"$6d\",\"$6e\",\"$6f\",\"$70\",\"$71\",\"$72\",\"$73\",\"$74\",\"$75\",\"$76\",\"$77\",\"$78\"],\"TableOfContents\"]\n96:[\"$\",\"$L95\",null,{\"id\":\"when-claude-searches\",\"name\":\"When Claude searches\",\"className\":\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100\"}]\n97:[\"$\",\"p\",\"26\",{\"children\":[\"Claude searches when the request depends on information that is current, changing, or outside its training data:\"]}]\n98:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"28\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"Recent events, news, or announcements\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":[\"Current prices, rates, scores, or statistics\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"5\",{\"children\":[\"Information about specific organizations, people, or products that might have changed\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"7\",{\"children\":[\"Ex3c:o1000,plicit requests to search or look something up\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n99:[\"$\",\"p\",\"30\",{\"children\":[\"Claude answers directly without searching when the request draws on stable knowledge:\"]}]\n9a:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"32\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"Established facts, math, science fundamentals, or coding concepts\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":[\"Creative writing or brainstorming\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"5\",{\"children\":[\"Analysis of content already provided in the conversation\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"7\",{\"children\":[\"Conversational turns and greetings\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n9b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"34\",{\"children\":[\"Triggering is steerable through your system prompt: you can encourage Claude to search more readily or to prefer answering directly. To enforce a limit, use \",[\"$\",\"$L93\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"#max-uses\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"code\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"max_uses\"]}]]}],\" to cap the number of searches in a turn.\"]}]\n9c:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"36\",{\"id\":\"dynamic-filtering\",\"className\":\"group\",\"children\":[[\"Dynamic filtering\"],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L95\",null,{\"id\":\"dynamic-filtering\",\"name\":\"Dynamic filtering\",\"className\":\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100\"}]}]]}]\n9d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"38\",{\"children\":[\"With basic web search, every search result is loaded into Claude’s context window, and much of that content can be irrelevant to the request. With \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"web_search_20260209\"]}],\" or later, Claude instead writes and runs code that filters the results first, so only relevant content reaches the context window. This reduces token use on search-heavy requests.\"]}]\n9e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"40\",{\"children\":[\"Dynamic filtering runs web search from inside \",[\"$\",\"$L93\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/code-execution-tool\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"code execution\"]}],\": on \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"3\",{\"children\":[\"web_search_20260209\"]}],\" and later, the tool’s \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"5\",{\"children\":[\"allowed_callers\"]}],\" field defaults to \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"7\",{\"children\":[\"[\\\"code_execution_20260120\\\"]\"]}],\", and when dynamic filtering runs, the API provisions the code execution it needs for the request automatically. You don’t need to add the code execution tool to \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"9\",{\"children\":[\"tools\"]}],\" yourself. There are no additional charges for code execution calls made this way beyond the standard token costs.\"]}]\n9f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"42\",{\"children\":[\"To call web search directly, without dynamic filtering, set \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"allowed_callers: [\\\"direct\\\"]\"]}],\". Models that don’t support programmatic tool calling require this setting. Without it, the API returns a 400 error that tells you to set it.\"]}]\na0:[\"$\",\"$L94\",\"44\",{\"variant\":\"muted\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"prose-block print:break-inside-avoid print:[:is(h2,h3,h4)+\u0026]:break-after-avoid\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"The web search tool (with and without dynamic filtering) is available on the Claude API, \",[\"$\",\"$L93\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/build-with-claude/claude-platform-on-aws\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"Claude Platform on AWS\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L93\",\"3\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/build-with-claude/claude-models-on-google-cloud/anthropic-managed\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"Claude Models on Google Cloud (Anthropic managed)\"]}],\", and \",[\"$\",\"$L93\",\"5\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/build-with-claude/claude-in-microsoft-foundry\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"Microsoft Foundry\"]}],\". On Microsoft Foundry, deployments \",[\"$\",\"$L93\",\"7\",{\"href\":\"/docs/en/build-with-claude/claude-in-microsoft-foundry#additional-features-not-supported-when-hosted-on-azure\",\"untracked\":false,\"children\":[\"hosted on Azure\"]}],\" support only the basic web search tool (\",[\"$\",\"code\",\"9\",{\"children\":[\"web_search_20250305\"]}],\", without dynamic filtering). Deployments hosted on Anthropic support all versions. On Claude Models on Google Cloud (Google managed), only the basic web search tool (without dy3c:oa7,namic filtering) is available.\"]}]]}]\na1:[\"$\",\"p\",\"46\",{\"children\":[\"The following examples use \",[\"$\",\"code\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"web_search_20260318\"]}],\":\"]}]\nf7:Ta07,3c:oa07,\u003cpre class=\"shiki\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"lj dt\"\u003ecurl\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"l3 dn\"\u003e https: